       fhir:short [ fhir:v "Patientenbezug" ] ;
       fhir:definition [ fhir:v "Who or what the document is about. The document can be about a person, (patient or healthcare practitioner), a device (e.g. a machine) or even a group of subjects (such as a document about a herd of farm animals, or a set of patients that share a common exposure)." ] ;
